#: src/development/windows.md:210
msgid "Build fails: Path too long"
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:212
msgid "You may receive an error like the following when building"
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:214
msgid ""
"```\n"
"error: failed to get `pet` as a dependency of package `languages v0.1.0 (D:"
"\\a\\zed-windows-builds\\zed-windows-builds\\crates\\languages)`\n"
"\n"
"Caused by:\n"
"  failed to load source for dependency `pet`\n"
"\n"
"Caused by:\n"
"  Unable to update https://github.com/microsoft/python-environment-tools.git?"
"rev=ffcbf3f28c46633abd5448a52b1f396c322e0d6c#ffcbf3f2\n"
"\n"
"Caused by:\n"
"  path too long: 'C:/Users/runneradmin/.cargo/git/checkouts/python-"
"environment-tools-903993894b37a7d2/ffcbf3f/crates/pet-conda/tests/unix/"
"conda_env_without_manager_but_found_in_history/some_other_location/"
"conda_install/conda-meta/python-fastjsonschema-2.16.2-py310hca03da5_0.json'; "
"class=Filesystem (30)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:227
msgid "To fix this, enable long-path support for both Git and Windows."
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:229
msgid "For git: `git config --system core.longpaths true`"
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:231
msgid "And for Windows with this PS command:"
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:233
msgid ""
"```powershell\n"
"New-ItemProperty -Path \"HKLM:"
"\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\FileSystem\" -Name "
"\"LongPathsEnabled\" -Value 1 -PropertyType DWORD -Force\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:237
msgid ""
"For more information on this, please see [win32 docs](https://learn."
"microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/fileio/maximum-file-path-limitation?"
"tabs=powershell)"
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:239
msgid "(You need to restart your system after enabling long-path support.)"
msgstr ""

